s and leap across the map.\n\nSolo Sandbox: Explore a stone testing area built for movement practice.\n\nSkill-Based Controls: No buttons for movement\u2014your physical arm motions control your speed and direction.\n\nStep into the world of Milo Taggers and see how fast you can move!", "short_description": "Explore a physics-based VR sandbox in Milo Taggers! Master unique movement, climb walls, and test your skills in an immersive parkour world."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rsTMCQnSIzUVuKHrwWmjpJaeOrU2K8Aht7AneJtC9lA/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "personvroffical", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/DDNkMKZkyU", "website_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/18EhtWGMt08-X8TRZWAh08oA0f0S_HblvpHDE7lM35fs/edit?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26494367366894506"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "947131384869054"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "947131384869054"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1776690840, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "947131384869054"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "26513638224967420", "version": "9999999999999999